1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,905
M: I couldn't attend the meeting this morning.

2
00:00:02,395 --> 00:00:05,805
Do you know when we are supposed to show up at the restaurant this evening?

3
00:00:06,465 --> 00:00:09,165
W: Well, Jack told everyone to be there by 7:00.

4
00:00:10,385 --> 00:00:14,305
He also said for any of us to call him if we are going to be late.

5
00:00:14,510 --> 00:00:15,085
M: Is that right?

6
00:00:15,710 --> 00:00:23,445
I have been asked to drop off some packages at our head office by Mr. Johnson, and I am not sure if I will be able to make it there on time.

7
00:00:24,115 --> 00:00:27,745
W: You know, if you are driving out there now, your best bet is to call Jack.

8
00:00:28,265 --> 00:00:31,365
Highway 10 usually gets pretty jammed during the time you come back.
